sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Warp SQL server
  C->>S: POST /warp/v1/sessions/{id}/ingest?table=trips&mode=create<br/>Content-Type: application/vnd.apache.arrow.stream<br/>(any size, chunked)
  Note over S: writes every batch, one transaction
  alt every row written
    S-->>C: 200 {"rows_ingested"}
  else it fails
    S-->>C: 4xx problem document, and no row remains
  end
